<title>UK: BOE allots 4.507 bln stg on UK money market repos.</title>
<headline>BOE allots 4.507 bln stg on UK money market repos.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England allotted a total 4.507 billion stg in repurchase and secured loan facilities at 5-23/32 percent for the UK money market.</p>
<p>It is offering 501 million stg on the repo maturing on November 7, 8 and 11 and 4.006 billion on the repo due November 21, 22 and 25.</p>
<p>The facilities open in equal on October 24, 25 and 28.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7708</p>
</text>
